### Tested versions

Observed in an exported commercial project using the "compatibility" (GLES3) renderer on Godot 4.6

Reported by Sentry for users running Windows with the following GPUs:
- AMD Radeon (TM) R5 M330
- AMD Radeon R9 200 Series


### System information

Windows - AMD Radeon (TM) R5 M330 and AMD Radeon R9 200 Series

### Issue description

Sentry reports shader compilation failures occurring at runtime. The failures affect multiple internal Godot shaders. The errors were captured through runtime logging and show compilation failures for:

- CanvasShaderGLES3
- SkeletonShaderGLES3
- SceneShaderGLES3

Below are the minimal shader logs captured by Sentry:

